ow the uniform set is getting freed in these cases. Since it looks like some sort of race condition despite all the relevant code being single threaded","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114073#pullrequestreview-3584481873","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114073","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-12-16T18:37:47Z"}]